{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00821","headline":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 肃雍舞 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 肃雍舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"周道载兴，象日之明。\n万邦咸庆，百谷用成。\n於穆圣祖，祗荐鸿名。\n祀於庙社，陈其牺牲。\n进旅退旅，皇武之形。\n一倡三叹，朱弦之声。\n以妥以侑，既和且平。\n至诚潜达，介福攸宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}